s of cigarette warning labels in the United States and Canada. Prev Chronic Dis [serial online] 2007 Apr [date cited]. Available from: URL: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2007/apr/06_0024.htm">http://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2007/apr/06_0024.htm</ext-link>				</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>